OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FAny showers
OL,6,Fsoon fading out to leave a dry night
OL,7,Fwith some clear spells in the east,
OL,8,Fgenerally cloudier in the west. Winds
OL,9,Ffalling light.
OL,10,
OL,11,CSaturday:FMainly dry although rather
OL,12,Fcloudy with a few bright spells.
OL,13,FOubtreaks of rain likely across the
OL,14,Fsouth later in the afternoon and
OL,15,Fevening.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
