OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FFurther
OL,6,Frain or showers at times, occasionally
OL,7,Fheavy, with some drier and brighter
OL,8,Fspells. Winds will be mostly light on
OL,9,FSunday but likely freshening on Monday
OL,10,Fand Tuesday.
